1
00:00:00,311 --> 00:00:02,841
(Leonard:)I don't think it matters
if this is a stalemate

2
00:00:02,847 --> 00:00:05,217
(Leonard:)or an impasse
or a Mexican standoff.

3
00:00:05,216 --> 00:00:06,446
(Leonard:)What are we gonna do here?

4
00:00:06,451 --> 00:00:08,181
(Man:)Oh, whoa, whoa, how can it be
a Mexican standoff?

5
00:00:08,186 --> 00:00:10,856
(Man:)Everybody knows you need
three sides for that.

6
00:00:10,855 --> 00:00:12,385
(Sheldon:)Not necessarily.

7
00:00:12,390 --> 00:00:14,790
(Sheldon:)Uh, many argue the essence
of a Mexican standoff

8
00:00:14,793 --> 00:00:17,063
(Sheldon:)is that no one can walk
away from the conflict

9
00:00:17,061 --> 00:00:19,161
(Sheldon:)without incurring harm.

10
00:00:19,164 --> 00:00:21,894
(Man:)Hmm, I don't follow.

11
00:00:21,900 --> 00:00:23,670
(Sheldon:)Let me give you an example.

12
00:00:23,668 --> 00:00:26,238
(Sheldon:)Earlier today,

13
00:00:26,237 --> 00:00:28,067
(Sheldon:)I decoded the headers
on your e-mail,

14
00:00:28,072 --> 00:00:30,302
(Sheldon:)and I know that your name is
Kenneth Fitzgerald.

15
00:00:30,308 --> 00:00:33,008
(Sheldon:)From that, I figured out where
you live and where you work.

16
00:00:33,011 --> 00:00:35,411
(Sheldon:)Now, to make this
a Mexican standoff,

17
00:00:35,413 --> 00:00:37,183
(Sheldon:)I would say something like, uh,

18
00:00:37,182 --> 00:00:40,782
“You give us the helium or I'll
turn you in to the authorities”"

19
00:00:40,785 --> 00:00:42,215
(Man:)Is that a threat?

20
00:00:42,220 --> 00:00:44,550
(Sheldon:)Yeah, exactly.
See, you're getting it.

21
00:00:44,556 --> 00:00:47,326
(Man:)Yeah, well, I know
where you work, all right?

22
00:00:47,325 --> 00:00:49,125
(Man:)And if you mess with me,
I'll report you,

23
00:00:49,127 --> 00:00:51,027
(Man:)then I'll pound your asses
into the ground.

24
00:00:51,029 --> 00:00:53,929
Perfect! Now we really are
in a Mexican standoff.

25
00:00:55,800 --> 00:00:57,570
(Sheldon:)Is this one of those times

26
00:00:57,569 --> 00:01:00,739
(Sheldon:)where I've won the battle
but lost the war?

